! S. Girhe, R. Langer, F. Loffredo, and H. Pitsch, "Ammonia combustion kinetic model
! optimization using elementary rate coefficient and global combustion data", manuscript in preparation for submission to Combustion and Flame (C&F).
! Built on C3MechV4.0.1. Rate parameters of 70 reactions were optimized using experimental and
! theoretical rate determinations from 140 publications and 11,273 indirect combustion measurements
! from 114 publications. Optimized lines are marked "!Girhe et al. (2026), C&F".
! Collider-specific falloff (LOWMX/LOWSP) was fitted
! with the linear mixture rule of Burke (LMR-R).
!
